            "heading_not_h2": false,
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<h3>RX Goggles: Crystal-Clear Vision for Every Swim</h3><p>Experience exceptional clarity and comfort with RX Goggles, designed to meet the needs of swimmers who demand precision underwater. Whether you're training in the pool or exploring open waters, these goggles offer reliable performance and a fit so secure, you'll feel confident with every stroke.</p><h4>Key Benefits</h4><ul><li>Prescription lenses for clear underwater vision.</li><li>Anti-fog coating and UV protection.</li><li>Adjustable strap and three nose bridge sizes for a perfect fit.</li><li>Soft hypoallegenic silicone eyecups for all-day comfort.</li><li>Durable polycarbonate lenses for long-lasting performance.</li><li>Available in Black or Blue. Hperopia (farsighted) or Myopia (shortsighted).</li><li>Includes earplugs, nose bridges, and a protective case.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
